{"id": "matthew_wf_wedding_roadmap_timeline", "prompt": "Search my Google Drive for our wedding roadmap doc. Extract all the key phases, upcoming milestone deadlines, and vendor tasks, then render an interactive, mobile-responsive HTML/CSS timeline artifact with milestone status badges and countdown markers. Do not ask clarifying questions; proceed directly to formulate the execution plan and build the artifact.", "category": "planning", "expect": {"min_steps": 2, "max_rounds": 6, "must_complete": true, "tools_any": ["google_drive_search", "google_drive_read_file", "delegate_to_code_agent", "delegate_to_traversal_agent", "render_diagram"], "scout_before_plan": true, "max_tool_repeats": 3}, "judge": ["planner_quality", "workflow_outcome"], "note": "Scout Drive for wedding roadmap -> plan milestone extraction -> generate interactive visual HTML timeline artifact."}
{"id": "matthew_wf_canvas_coursework_heatmap", "prompt": "Check Canvas LMS for all my enrolled courses. Retrieve all upcoming assignments, quizzes, and project milestones due over the next 2 weeks, then render an interactive HTML priority matrix that color-codes urgent items vs future tasks. Do not ask clarifying questions; proceed directly to formulate the execution plan.", "category": "planning", "expect": {"min_steps": 2, "max_rounds": 6, "must_complete": true, "tools_any": ["get_canvas_courses", "get_assignments", "get_course_assignments", "delegate_to_canvas_agent", "delegate_to_code_agent"], "scout_before_plan": true, "max_tool_repeats": 3}, "judge": ["planner_quality", "workflow_outcome"], "note": "Canvas API coursework discovery -> decompose upcoming work -> generate color-coded HTML deadline dashboard."}
{"id": "matthew_wf_life_plans_dashboard", "prompt": "Cross-reference our 'life plans' document in Google Drive with what you know from memory about my career, family, and personal goals. Build a visual 'Life Dashboard' HTML artifact organizing our goals into categories (Career, Personal, Financial, Family) with status tags and immediate next actions. Do not ask clarifying questions; proceed directly to formulate the execution plan.", "category": "planning", "expect": {"min_steps": 2, "max_rounds": 6, "must_complete": true, "tools_any": ["google_drive_search", "google_drive_read_file", "manage_user_memory", "delegate_to_code_agent"], "scout_before_plan": true, "max_tool_repeats": 3}, "judge": ["planner_quality", "workflow_outcome"], "note": "Multi-source retrieval (Drive + user memory) -> synthesize authentic goals -> render interactive multi-card dashboard."}
{"id": "matthew_wf_noel_finance_brief", "prompt": "Review our financial notes and family context from memory and Drive. Generate an interactive expense/savings breakdown donut chart using an artifact, find a top-tier educational personal finance or investing video, and draft a warm, clear summary email to Jordan with the highlights. Do not send the email; leave it as a draft. Do not ask clarifying questions; proceed directly to formulate the execution plan.", "category": "planning", "expect": {"min_steps": 3, "max_rounds": 7, "must_complete": true, "tools_any": ["manage_user_memory", "google_drive_search", "render_chart", "show_youtube_video", "web_search", "create_gmail_draft", "draft_gmail_reply"], "scout_before_plan": true, "max_tool_repeats": 3}, "judge": ["planner_quality", "workflow_outcome"], "note": "Multi-agent planning: memory/drive check -> chart render -> educational video search -> email draft creation without premature sending."}
{"id": "matthew_wf_canvas_interactive_quizlet", "prompt": "Look up my current engineering/coursework module on Canvas LMS, review the latest lecture files and key topics, and build a self-contained, clickable interactive HTML/JS quizlet artifact with 5 practice questions to test my understanding. Do not ask clarifying questions; proceed directly to formulate the execution plan.", "category": "planning", "expect": {"min_steps": 2, "max_rounds": 6, "must_complete": true, "tools_any": ["get_canvas_courses", "get_course_files", "get_module_items", "delegate_to_canvas_agent", "delegate_to_code_agent"], "scout_before_plan": true, "max_tool_repeats": 3}, "judge": ["planner_quality", "workflow_outcome"], "note": "Canvas module extraction -> formulate quiz items -> generate functional interactive JavaScript quizlet artifact."}
{"id": "matthew_wf_theknot_vendor_kanban", "prompt": "Check my latest wedding vendor communications (on The Knot or recent vendor threads in Gmail). Identify which vendors are still waiting on our input, and render a clean Kanban-style HTML action board categorized into 'To Decide', 'Awaiting Vendor', and 'Confirmed'. Do not ask clarifying questions; proceed directly to formulate the execution plan.", "category": "planning", "expect": {"min_steps": 2, "max_rounds": 6, "must_complete": true, "tools_any": ["browser_navigate", "browser_snapshot", "search_gmail", "delegate_to_browser_agent", "delegate_to_code_agent"], "max_tool_repeats": 3}, "judge": ["planner_quality", "workflow_outcome"], "note": "Signed-in/Gmail vendor triage -> extract vendor state -> render interactive Kanban HTML action board."}
{"id": "matthew_wf_drive_guest_rsvp_kpi", "prompt": "Search Google Drive for our wedding guest list or RSVP spreadsheet. Calculate total invited, total confirmed, pending RSVPs, and any dietary flags, then render an executive summary HTML widget with metric KPI cards and a progress bar. Do not ask clarifying questions; proceed directly to formulate the execution plan.", "category": "planning", "expect": {"min_steps": 2, "max_rounds": 6, "must_complete": true, "tools_any": ["google_drive_search", "google_drive_read_file", "delegate_to_code_agent"], "scout_before_plan": true, "max_tool_repeats": 3}, "judge": ["planner_quality", "workflow_outcome"], "note": "Drive guest spreadsheet calculation -> synthesize metrics -> render KPI card and progress bar HTML widget."}
{"id": "matthew_wf_weekly_unified_scheduler", "prompt": "Check my Google Calendar for the next 7 days, pull all Canvas LMS assignments due this week, and scan Gmail for unread action items. Combine all three into a unified, interactive HTML weekly planner divided by day, with tags for 'School', 'Personal', and 'Meeting'. Do not ask clarifying questions; proceed directly to formulate the execution plan.", "category": "planning", "expect": {"min_steps": 3, "max_rounds": 7, "must_complete": true, "tools_any": ["google_calendar_check", "get_canvas_courses", "get_assignments", "search_gmail", "delegate_to_code_agent"], "scout_before_plan": true, "max_tool_repeats": 3}, "judge": ["planner_quality", "workflow_outcome"], "note": "3-way service coordination (Calendar, Canvas, Gmail) -> conflict/deadline merging -> interactive weekly HTML agenda."}
{"id": "matthew_wf_tech_knowledge_diagram", "prompt": "From what you know about my tech interests and coding projects in memory, research 3 cutting-edge developments from this past month in those specific areas, and render an interactive SVG or Mermaid concept diagram connecting these trends to what I'm currently building. Do not ask clarifying questions; proceed directly to formulate the execution plan.", "category": "planning", "expect": {"min_steps": 2, "max_rounds": 6, "must_complete": true, "tools_any": ["manage_user_memory", "web_search", "render_diagram", "delegate_to_code_agent"], "scout_before_plan": true, "max_tool_repeats": 3}, "judge": ["planner_quality", "workflow_outcome"], "note": "Memory recall of user interests -> external web research -> render connected Mermaid/SVG diagram artifact."}
{"id": "matthew_wf_honeymoon_honest_grounding", "prompt": "Check our wedding roadmap in Google Drive and my memory for our finalized honeymoon flight details and itinerary. If they are NOT yet finalized or booked, do NOT keep searching or make up dummy flights—immediately stop and present a simple HTML checklist of what decisions are still pending. Do not ask clarifying questions; proceed directly to formulate the execution plan.", "category": "planning", "expect": {"min_steps": 1, "max_rounds": 5, "must_complete": true, "tools_any": ["google_drive_search", "manage_user_memory", "delegate_to_code_agent"], "max_tool_repeats": 2}, "judge": ["planner_quality", "workflow_outcome"], "note": "Anti-spiral / honest grounding check: detects incomplete data in Drive/memory and terminates cleanly with pending checklist."}
